# Unrelated project cloned into this working tree.
# Notin/ is its own repository (remote: bruce12-glitch/Notin) with its own
# .git. Without this line it shows as untracked clutter and `git add -A`
# here would try to record it as a submodule gitlink, which is not what
# anyone wants and fails confusingly on push.
Notin/
